.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt DTLS_GET_DATA_MTU 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm DTLS_get_data_mtu
.Nd Get maximum data payload size
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/ssl.h
.Ft size_t
.Fo DTLS_get_data_mtu
.Fa "const SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This function obtains the maximum data payload size for the established
DTLS connection
.Fa ssl ,
based on the DTLS record MTU and the overhead of the DTLS record header,
encryption and authentication currently in use.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the maximum data payload size on success, or 0 on failure.
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn DTLS_get_data_mtu
function was added in OpenSSL 1.1.1.
